note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note seed/ng/formal_emit/lean_emit.om: Pure seeded OM-2 Per-Binary Lean 4 Auto-Formalizer
note and mandatory pre-W^X-seal verifier (`lean_emit`).
note
note Link order (program mode, seed/ng/src/ir.om supplies `om2` on line 1):
note   cat seed/ng/src/ir.om seed/ng/sha256.om seed/ng/target/target_desc.om \
note       seed/ng/target/chips_tsv.om seed/ng/target/regalloc.om \
note       seed/ng/target/isel.om seed/ng/target/sm121_pe.om \
note       seed/ng/formal_emit/lean_emit.om | seed/out/omc > lean_emit
note
note Usage:
note   lean_emit --unit FILE --out RX_BIN [--cert-out FILE.lean] [--lean PATH] [--workdir DIR] [--chips FILE] [--rwx]
note   lean_emit --verify-cert FILE.lean --out RX_BIN [--lean PATH] [--workdir DIR] [--rwx]

